      "para_start": false,
      "is_catchword": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "eSc_line_03b2e99d",
      "kind": "main",
      "idx": 40,
      "text": "הגירסא שלפנינו בתלמוד בע\"ז דט\"ל ע\"ב ועיין מוסף הערוך ערך סר אחרון ודוק ונמצא דהכל אחד",
      "coords": {
        "HPOS": 337,
        "VPOS": 2735,
        "WIDTH": 1989,
        "HEIGHT": 79
      },
      "para_start": false,
      "is_catchword": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "eSc_line_2ff23e68",
      "kind": "main",
      "idx": 41,
      "text": "?סימן",
      "coords": {
        "HPOS": 1267,
        "VPOS": 2841,
        "WIDTH": 202,
        "HEIGHT": 96
      },
      "para_start": false,
      "is_catchword": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "eSc_line_ec595dc3",
      "kind": "main",
      "idx": 42,
      "text": "והיכא",
      "coords": {
        "HPOS": 2118,
        "VPOS": 2948,
        "WIDTH": 206,
        "HEIGHT": 78
      },
      "para_start": false,
      "is_catchword": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "eSc_line_a4cd70fe",
      "kind": "main",
      "idx": 43,
